<title>INDIA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT INDIA BY 329 RUNS IN SECOND TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT INDIA BY 329 RUNS IN SECOND TEST.</headline>
<dateline>CALCUTTA 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa beat India by 329 runs to win the second test against India on the fifth and final day at Calcutta's Eden Gardens.</p>
<p>India were all out for 137 runs in their second innings.</p>
</text>
